{"path":"chemistry/experiments/lab/industrial-flow-example","title":"工业流程除杂（调 pH 不引杂质）","type":"example","html":"<p><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{CuSO_4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">CuS</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 溶液中混有少量 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Fe^{3+}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">F</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">3</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，为除去 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Fe^{3+}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">F</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">3</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 且<strong>不引入新的杂质</strong>，下列方案最合理的是（ ）</p>\n<p>A. 加入适量 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{CuO}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">CuO</span></span></span></span></span> 粉末，搅拌使其充分反应后过滤</p>\n<p>B. 加入过量 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{NaOH}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">NaOH</span></span></span></span></span> 溶液，过滤</p>\n<p>C. 加入过量铁粉，搅拌后过滤</p>\n<p>D. 加入适量氨水，搅拌后过滤</p>\n<ul>\n<li>调 pH 沉淀的<strong>两个前提</strong>（大题必写）：① 目标离子沉淀时 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{pH}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">pH</span></span></span></span></span> 明显高于杂质离子（Ksp 差异）；② 调 pH 试剂不引入新杂质；</li>\n<li>若溶液含 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Zn^{2+}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Z</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：调 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{pH}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">pH</span></span></span></span></span> 用 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{ZnO}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">ZnO</span></span></span></span></span>/<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Zn(OH)_2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Zn</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">OH</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（目标离子自身氧化物）——<strong>&quot;用谁的溶液，用谁的氧化物调 pH&quot;</strong>；</li>\n<li>变式：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Fe^{2+}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">F</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 杂质要先氧化成 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Fe^{3+}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">F</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">3</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{H_2O_2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）再调 pH——&quot;先氧化后沉淀&quot;是流程题的经典两步（Fe²⁺ 沉淀 pH 高，直接沉会拖累目标离子）；</li>\n<li>风险：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{CuO}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">CuO</span></span></span></span></span> 过量没关系（不溶物过滤即可，且不引入离子）；&quot;过滤&quot;一定要写——沉淀+滤液分离是步骤分。</li>\n</ul>\n","standardHtml":"<p><strong>原理</strong>：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Fe^{3+}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">F</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">3</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 水解 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>⇌</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Fe^{3+}+3H_2O\\rightleftharpoons Fe(OH)_3+3H^+}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">F</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">3</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">3</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇌</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Fe</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">OH</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">3</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；加入能与 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.08125em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 反应的碱性物质会<strong>促进水解</strong>使之沉淀完全，而 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Cu^{2+}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 沉淀所需 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{pH}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">pH</span></span></span></span></span> 更高（留在溶液中）。</p>\n<p><strong>逐项分析</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>A</strong>：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{CuO+2H^+=Cu^{2+}+H_2O}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9641em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">CuO</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></s